on the back of this thing.

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:38.200
[ Laughter and applause ]
I don't know.

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:38.934
It's yellow."

00:06:44.501 --> 00:06:45.901
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:06:45.901 --> 00:06:48.367
Thank you, au jus,

00:06:48.367 --> 00:06:51.033
