a really fancy sneeze.

00:06:51.033 --> 00:06:53.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:56.334
Au jus!

00:06:56.334 --> 00:06:57.667
[ Laughter ]

00:06:57.667 --> 00:07:00.300
-Gesundheit.
-[ Chuckles ]

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:01.067
Oui oui.

00:07:01.067 --> 00:07:02.501
[ Laughter ]

00:07:02.501 --> 00:07:04.234
Could you wee-wee
