00:07:08.334 --> 00:07:10.567
-Well, it was weird
because it was European, so.
[You're a-peein']

00:07:10.567 --> 00:07:12.501
[ Laughter ]
You know, French.

00:07:17.734 --> 00:07:19.033
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:07:19.033 --> 00:07:21.467
-Thank you, Korn and Toys"R"Us,

00:07:21.467 --> 00:07:23.601
