00:07:27.133 --> 00:07:28.167
Respect.

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:31.300
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:35.033
Thank you, light blinking
on my Wi-Fi router,

00:07:35.033 --> 00:07:36.601
for either meaning
it's completely broken

00:07:36.601 --> 00:07:37.834
or working perfectly.

00:07:37.834 --> 00:07:40.267
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:40.267 --> 00:07:41.901
It's blinking.

00:07:41.901 --> 00:07:42.567
That's a good thing.

00:07:45.567 --> 00:07:46.901
♪♪
[ Laughter ]

00:07:46.901 --> 00:07:49.200
Thank you, Entenmann's,
for bringing back

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:51.334
